Flow Down
node A "Agent opens a PR" box
node B "CI green?" diamond
node C "Request review" box
node D "Fix failing checks" box tone=Danger
node E "Approved?" diamond
node F "Address comments and push" box
node G "Merge" pill fill="#d1fae5"
edge e0 A -> B Solid none..arrow
edge e1 B -> C Solid none..arrow "yes"
edge e2 B -> D Solid none..arrow "no"
edge e3 D -> B Solid none..arrow
edge e4 C -> E Solid none..arrow
edge e5 E -> F Solid none..arrow "changes requested"
edge e6 F -> C Solid none..arrow
edge e7 E -> G Solid none..arrow "approved"
